<title>UK: TBI sells property for 49 mln stg.</title>
<headline>TBI sells property for 49 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Property company TBI Plc said on Thursday that it has agreed to sell a freehold UK property known as The Fountains to Springlake Business Inc for 49 million stg in cash.  </p>
<p>The property, situated at Brentford, Middlesex, in west London operates annual net rentals of 4.3 million before interest costs.</p>
<p>TBI said the proceeds of the sale will be used to reduce debt related to the asset and to supplement the general cash resources of the group.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
